'''Sit-Down Sunday''' is a community event organized by the [[PZ Modding Community]] where modders or experienced game devs can come and share their knowledge to other experienced and inexperienced modders. The event is held on a Sunday on the Discord server of the modding community and is recorded and reuploaded for those who could not attend (currently on [https://www.youtube.com/@SimKDT SimKDT's channel]). Anyone is welcome to join the event and ask questions to the speakers. If you have something interesting you want to share, you can propose yourself as a speaker for any date of your choice for a presentation in english.

The following subjects have been covered in the past events:
* Low-poly modeling, topology
* Modeling and texturing a gun
* Modding documentation, setting up a modding environment and modding resources

There are no limitations in how you present your subject, of the time you take, or the subject you want to present, as long as it's related to modding.

